  "description": "After their battle with vampires and recovering from the aftermath, Keith and First are moving forward. Keith has been appointed chairman of his family’s company, and First is still working as an agent. Amid it all, they’ve finally acknowledged their love for each other. How will they manage to navigate their new status, and alone time, while dealing with family and obligations?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
